{"id":"8b817c9c5f40","publishedAt":1794430800000,"posts":[[{"bold":true,"text":"【竜王戦】千田翔太八段が藤本渚六段に勝ち、４組３位で３組昇級"},{"br":1},{"href":"https://i2chmeijin.com/blog-category-6.html","text":"竜王戦"},{"text":" \n 2026/11/11"},{"text":"21:00"},{"text":"35"},{"br":1},{"size":13,"text":"\n竜王戦４組　　○　千田翔太　　藤本　渚　● 　 \n"},{"br":1},{"img":"https://blog-imgs-187.fc2.com/i/2/c/i2chmeijin/20261111084530256.png"},{"br":1},{"size":13,"href":"https://www.shogi.or.jp/match/ryuuou/39/4hon.html","text":"https://www.shogi.or.jp/match/ryuuou/39/4hon.html"},{"br":1},{"color":"#333333","size":13,"text":"スポンサーリンク"}],[{"bold":true,"size":16,"text":" 千田よく凌ぎ切ったな "},{"br":1},{"bold":true,"size":16,"text":" これはA級八段 "}],[{"bold":true,"size":16,"color":"#0033CC","text":">>654"},{"br":1},{"bold":true,"size":16,"text":" なおA4からA3に復帰 "}],[{"bold":true,"size":16,"text":" おー詰むのか。千田、疑ってごめんｗ 腐ってもA級やねぇ "}],[{"bold":true,"size":16,"text":" 千田に対する信頼度よw "},{"br":1},{"bold":true,"size":16,"text":" 千田おめ藤本乙 "}],[{"bold":true,"size":16,"text":" 振り飛車には角交換ならぬ藤本には角交換か "}],[{"bold":true,"size":16,"text":" 得意の雁木を封じられるとこうなるのか "}],[{"bold":true,"size":16,"text":" 藤本重症だな "},{"br":1},{"bold":true,"size":16,"text":" こんなに負けが込むのは棋士人生初めてじゃないか "}],[{"bold":true,"size":16,"text":" この状態の藤本だと同じように絶不調な匠でも勝てそうだな "},{"br":1},{"size":10,"text":"\n引用元："},{"size":10,"text":"https://mevius.5ch.io/test/read.cgi/bgame/1793784305/"},{"br":1},{"href":"https://i2chmeijin.com/blog-entry-24080.html?sp&m2=form","text":"コメント"},{"br":1},{"href":"https://i2chmeijin.com/blog-entry-24080.html?sp&m2=form","text":"を書く"},{"br":1},{"href":"https://i2chmeijin.com/blog-entry-24080.html?sp&m2=res","text":"コメント"},{"br":1},{"href":"https://i2chmeijin.com/blog-entry-24080.html?sp&m2=res","text":"(35)"}]],"comments":[]}